    "article_summary": "The article describes a dual nickel-photoredox catalytic system for the direct functionalization of alpha-amino C(sp3)-H bonds with aryl halides. By generating alpha-amino radicals under mild conditions using an iridium photocatalyst, the system enables cross-coupling with a broad range of electronically diverse aryl halides and N-aryl amines, including complex bioactive molecules, to produce benzylic amines.",
